                    "speaker": "Jingda",
                    "text": "*sigh*"
                },
                {
                    "id": "621050102",
                    "speaker": "Jingda",
                    "text": "Why am I so unlucky, that of all the people you could have spoken to, you chose me?"
                }
            ]
